## 5. Workspace Structure

This workspace is organized around industry topics. Companies are subdirectories of their primary industry:

```text
industry/
  <industry-slug>/
    index.md                  # Industry overview + company registry
    companies/
      <ticker>/               # Company subdirectory — one home per company
        [YYYY-MM-DD]-*.md
        _cache/
    [YYYY-MM-DD]-*.md        # Industry-level artifact
    _cache/
COVERAGE.md                   # Coverage status tracker (thesis stage / priority / next catalyst)
```

Core constraints:
- Company artifacts go in `industry/<industry>/companies/<ticker>/`; industry artifacts go in the industry root
- Cross-industry companies are registered as references in multiple industry `index.md` files; the files themselves do not move
- `_cache/` stores source-tracked parsed materials, evidence packs, and structured data
- Topic artifact naming is resolved uniformly by `new-session`
- Workspace hooks are part of the runtime contract — do not manually edit or delete

